# User Authentication and Authorization API


This project implements user authentication and authorization using Bearer tokens (JWT) in a Node.js application with Express.js and MongoDB (Mongoose). It follows the MVC pattern.

**Note:** This project uses ECMAScript modules (ESM) with `import`/`export` syntax. Ensure you are using **Node.js v16 or higher** for full compatibility.

## Features
- User registration with hashed passwords
- User login with JWT token generation
- Protected route to get user info
- JWT-based authentication middleware
- Clean, modular code structure

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB & Mongoose
- JWT (jsonwebtoken)
- bcryptjs
bcryptjs

